<title>USA: Shuffle Master unveils video Let It Ride.</title>
<headline>Shuffle Master unveils video Let It Ride.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shuffle Master Inc said it unveiled Thursday the video version of its Let It Ride poker game.</p>
<p>Twelve machines will be used for play at the Mystic Lake Casino in Prior Lake, Minnesota, the company said.</p>
<p>A table version of the game is already popular in Nevada, but Minnesota gaming laws do not allow table games other than blackjack, the company said.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
